    </ul>
    <p>If I can't resolve the issue, you can also take it to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The U.S. Department of Justice's ADA Information Line: 1-800-514-0301 (voice) or 1-833-610-1264 (TTY).</li>
      <li>Your state's protection and advocacy organization.</li>
    </ul>

